SUMMARY:Home Brewed
DESCRIPTION:Home Brewed is back! We’re showcasing artists\, musicians\, vendors\, and organizations that heavily impact the Durham community. Durham is where great people meet the perfect vibes and Home Brewed aims to capture that essence for a wonderful Saturday in the Bull. \nLive Music Performances\nWe focus on the blossoming talent in the area who can command any stage. We’re intently traveling across genres and embracing all vibes. With BreYonnaBeats setting the tone\, our lineup is instantly infused with amazing energy. \nThe Lineup\nTesh\nDefacto Thezpian\nAri Quinn\nXbrodie\nC.Shreve The Professor\nAnd more! \nArt\nWe’re highlighting talented visual and performance artists that move the soul. We’ll have Live Painting throughout the evening and a fun nightcap you don’t want to miss\, featuring Burlesque and Fire art. \nVendors/Organizations\nSupreme Well-being\nVenus Wraps\nBites By Ashley\nCleaning Essentials\nJoRose’s Follies\nYouCanVote\nSweet Tooth\, LLC\nPufferfish Project\nMere’s DooDads\nCNOTE \nDonate to CNOTE\nCNOTE events are all about connected community and art at a local level. Our mission to fund HBCUs remains the driving force for bringing people together and highlighting venues and artists throughout North Carolina. Any donations we receive go directly towards funding our endowments at North Carolina A&T State University and North Carolina Central University.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/home-brewed/
LOCATION:Durty Bull Brewing Company\, 206 Broadway Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Food & Drink,Food Vendors/Food Trucks,Live Performance,Music,Shopping,Wines, Spirits, Beer and Cheer
